OL,3,GNEWSACould the cycling ban be lifted in
OL,4,AWorcester city centre?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 20-year cycling ban in Worcester city
OL,7,Fcentre could be relaxed in a bid to
OL,8,Fencourage people to dump their cars.
OL,10,FWorcester City Council is pushing for
OL,11,Fan investigation over watering down a
OL,12,Ftraffic regulation order (TRO) which
OL,13,Fbars cycling between 10:00 and 18:00
OL,14,Fthrough city centre streets.
OL,16,FThe rule was introduced in 2006 to help
OL,17,Fpedestrians and shoppers navigate the
OL,18,Fcity safely.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
