OL,3,GNEWSACould the cycling ban be lifted in
OL,4,AWorcester city centre?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Councillor Tor Pingree said: "A
OL,7,Flot of cyclists do say the city is very
OL,8,F'unfriendly' for people who want to
OL,9,Fcycle - it's about time it was looked
OL,10,Fat again."
